# langertha-llm-advisor: verified header shapes + one recommended API (2026-09-01)

Provider docs read 2026-09-01. No live API calls. The ticket's premise ("seconds, RFC3339, or
epoch") is right in kind but wrong in detail: the dominant shape is neither bare seconds nor
epoch, it is a **Go `time.Duration.String()` string**, and it can be compound and sub-second.

## What the wire actually carries

